  "title": "IEEE 802.11: Add FTM Sync Info extended tag",
  "description": "This tag contains a single element, which is the 4-octet field TSF Sync\nInfo.\n\nI tested it on a packet with the upstream code:\n\n```\n        Ext Tag: FTM Synchronization Information: Undecoded\n            Tag Number: Element ID Extension (255)\n            Ext Tag length: 4\n            Ext Tag Number: FTM Synchronization Information (9)\n            Ext Tag Data: 7c09be02\n            [Expert Info (Note/Undecoded): Dissector for 802.11 Extension Tag (FTM Synchronization Information) code not implemented, Contact Wireshark developers if you want this supported]\n                [Dissector for 802.11 Extension Tag (FTM Synchronization Information) code not implemented, Contact Wireshark developers if you want this supported]\n                [Severity level: Note]\n                [Group: Undecoded]\n```\n\nWith this commit: (basically the same info but without the undecoded warning message)\n\n```\n        Ext Tag: FTM Synchronization Information\n            Tag Number: Element ID Extension (255)\n            Ext Tag length: 4\n            Ext Tag Number: FTM Synchronization Information (9)\n            TSF Sync Info: 7c09be02\n```",
  "state": "merged",
